  </code>
  transitions: 7-2-redis-session-state
end note

note bottom of HISTORY
  <code>
  {"role": "user", "type": "text",
   "content": "The street floods every time it rains"}
  {"role": "assistant", "type": "text",
   "content": "How deep does the water get?"}
  </code>
  image: type = "image", content = the file path
end note

note as GLOBAL
  No key has an expiry - no command sets one (TTL -1).
  The session keys go away only through clear_buffer, clear_state and clear_session.
  ping() sends PING and touches no key.
end note
@enduml
